{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/30865-manipulating-the-sahu","id":30865,"title":"Manipulating the Sahu","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-16T02:46:04-08:00","id":30865,"title":"Manipulating the Sahu","content":"So I had a funny thought. Can a mummy manipulate their Sahu (their form made out of Sekhem so they don't look like a shambling corpse) to change their gender (at least in a visible sense, not a physical one)? And then I thought of the broader question, how far can a mummy manipulate their Sahu?<br /> <br /> My logic is that mummies can give themselves &quot;working&quot; organs with enough knowledge. Also multiple Affinities and Utterances change the mummies form, including the physical khat (the real body). What's stopping them from changing how they look as well?<br /> <br /> A mummy can become a completely different person. Or they may even be able to become a horrifying creature if they tried. Or maybe a mummy is more comfortable as the opposite gender (that was my original idea, trangender mummy). Or maybe just looking like the locals so they don't stick out like a sore thumb.<br /> <br /> So is it possible? TELL ME!!!! <span style=\"font-size:8px\">please...</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T04:07:17-08:00","id":30890,"title":"","content":"Probably not consciously, and not without the use of an appropriate power. The sahu is a reflection of the mummy's memory of what he used to look like, right? There's no conscious choice involved.<br /> <br /> I could absolutely see thematic space for powers designed to change the sahu, however.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T04:42:50-08:00","id":30901,"title":"","content":"Of course, with screwy memories if they went to sleep and awoke again with a very strong recent memory from their last descent of being the opposite gender or with strong memories related to that they could find themselves forming their Sahu differently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T08:11:44-08:00","id":30975,"title":"","content":"Changes to the Sahu with time seem to be mostly based on unconscious assumptions. For example, a mummy who remembers her height not as a unit of measurement (who even uses cubits anymore?) but rather as &quot;not much shorter than most people&quot;, will tend to stay <i>not much shorter than most people</i> even as the average height has changed drastically since her birth. Errors in the memory seem to take the form of abridging, shorthanding, or leaving data out rather than specifically misremembering it, <br /> <br /> Big, conscious changes would tend to fall under the Utterance &quot;Jar of Clay&quot; in Guildhalls","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/996-gabby","name":"Gabby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T04:56:05-08:00","id":31587,"title":"","content":"If you read about a Shuankhsen's sahu in the Storyteller's Section of the core book I think you'll come across an interesting idea. I'm sure it could apply to Arisen who choose or are forced to resurrect into a new body as well.<br /> <br /> One hint we've had about Cursed Necropolis: DC is that there will be a character whose gender is very ambiguous, too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T06:50:57-08:00","id":31625,"title":"","content":"I wrote the character of Hebeny, in part, to address this very question. (Short answer: no. The best you'll get is a heavy reduction of secondary sexual characteristics, resulting in an androgyne appearance that may be further modified by mundane methods. Those mundane methods can be pretty extensive and complete!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T13:52:18-08:00","id":31882,"title":"","content":"If a Mummy does extensive modifications to his body in one life (cutting hair, getting tattoos, gets gender reassignment surgery), does it last into the next? Does it fade a little? Or does the khat/sahu relationship go back to default. Similarly, for the Twice Arisen, do they look Mummified and smell like a mummy when their sekhem is high, or do they look as though they died from whatever trauma killed the new host?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T15:26:41-08:00","id":31942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/30865-manipulating-the-sahu?p=31625#post31625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote the character of Hebeny, in part, to address this very question. (Short answer: no. The best you'll get is a heavy reduction of secondary sexual characteristics, resulting in an androgyne appearance that may be further modified by mundane methods. Those mundane methods can be pretty extensive and complete!)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I'm looking forward to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}